OL,3,GNEWSA'Lifeline' swimming group
OL,4,Acelebrating 50 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group founded to make swimming
OL,7,Faccessible is planning a celebration to
OL,8,Fcommemorate its golden anniversary.
OL,10,FKeynsham Seals Disabled Swimming Club
OL,11,Fwas set up to make sure adults and
OL,12,Fchildren with disabilities and
OL,13,Fneurodivergence can learn to swim in a
OL,14,Fcomfortable and welcoming enviroment.
OL,16,FFirst opened in 1976, the group has
OL,17,Fsince grown having access to hoists
OL,18,Fmeaning attendants can swim safely.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
