OL,3,GNEWSA'Lifeline' swimming group
OL,4,Acelebrating 50 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FClub chairperson Rachel Parker said it
OL,7,Fbecame a big part of her daughter's
OL,8,Flife after the Covid-19 pandemic.
OL,9,FParker said: "It was a really difficult
OL,10,Ftime. We'd already been to Seals for a
OL,11,Fyear or two, and it was just a lifeline
OL,12,Fto come back every Sunday."
